玉兰图案，腰间系着一块莹润的羊脂白玉流苏禁步。她的发丝被精心挽成如云的传统高髻，斜插着一支镶嵌着珍珠与翠玉的金色步摇，步摇的流苏仿佛随着微风在轻轻摇曳。女子的妆容清透高雅，眉如远山，眼若秋水，唇点樱红，面带一抹柔和而宁静的微笑。背景是一座幽静雅致的传统中式庭院，透过精美的雕花木漏窗，可以看到几枝正在盛开的粉色桃花和随风拂动的翠绿垂柳，远处隐约有一座古朴的太湖石假山。柔和的清晨阳光穿透枝叶，在她的丝绸衣摆和白皙的脸庞上投下斑驳的光影。空气中弥漫着诗意与古典的韵味，整体氛围温婉、神秘且宁静，画面色彩柔和唯美，光影层次丰富，画质细腻逼真，完美捕捉了东方美学的极致神韵。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 165, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 31}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "*", "links": [153], "type": "*", "localized_name": "*"}], "size": [263.9288024902344, 238], "pos": [351.8885192871094, 1013.3887329101562], "widgets_values": [0], "inputs": [{"name": "value0", "link": 156, "label": "值_0", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value1", "link": 157, "label": "值_1", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value2", "link": 158, "label": "值_2", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value3", "link": 159, "label": "值_3", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value4", "label": "值_4", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value5", "label": "值_5", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value6", "label": "值_6", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value7", "label": "值_7", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value8", "label": "值_8", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "value9", "label": "值_9", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value9"}, {"widget": {"name": "index"}, "name": "index", "link": 154, "type": "INT", "localized_name": "索引"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 95, "type": "InversionDemoLazyIndexSwitch", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Inversio